        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Flux.2 Klein 4B \u2014 Full Quality Pipeline\n\nBase gen (1024\u00b2) \u2192 4x ESRGAN upscale \u2192 downscale to 2048\u00b2 \u2192 hires-fix pass (denoise 0.5) \u2192 final save.\n\n### Models needed\n- `diffusion_models/flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors`\n- `text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors`\n- `vae/flux2-vae.safetensors`\n- `upscale_models/4x-UltraSharp.pth`\n\n### Adding FaceDetailer (optional, manual step)\nSearch-add `FaceDetailer`, `UltralyticsDetectorProvider`, `SAMLoader` nodes. Wire FaceDetailer's image input from the final VAEDecode, model/clip/vae from the loaders on the left, positive/negative from the two CLIPTextEncode nodes, bbox_detector from UltralyticsDetectorProvider, sam_model from SAMLoader. Route its output to a new SaveImage.\n\n### Settings\n- CFG fixed at 1.0 on both guiders \u2014 Klein uses embedded guidance, not classic CFG\n- Pass 1: 20 steps, native 1024\u00b2\n- Pass 2 (hires-fix): 12 steps, denoise 0.5, at 2048\u00b2\n- Two SaveImage nodes: pre-upscale base (for comparison) and final\n\n### 6GB VRAM note\nLaunch ComfyUI with `--lowvram`."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
